        "original_id": "1782d0df-956d-59d0-a676-c31c602957c3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Studio Ponoc\n- Places: Musashino, Tokyo, Japan\n- Products: Mary and the Witch's Flower, The Little Broomstick\n- People: Hiromasa Yonebayashi, Mary Stewart\n- Topics: Japanese animation, anime fantasy film\n\nFacts:\n- Studio Ponoc is a Japanese animation studio based in Musashino, Tokyo, Japan.\n- Mary Stewart wrote The Little Broomstick.\n- Mary and the Witch's Flower is a 2017 Japanese anime fantasy film.\n- Hiromasa Yonebayashi directed Mary and the Witch's Flower.\n- Studio Ponoc produced Mary and the Witch's Flower.\n- Mary and the Witch's Flower is based on The Little Broomstick by Mary Stewart.",
